"id": 21492,
"en": "A simple life by the water is perfect for me, so don't worry.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 63
},
{
"id": 21493,
"en": "But wouldn't to you guys just find another bar if I left?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21494,
"en": "We're gonna stay devoted to your bar, Mama.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 47
},
{
"id": 21495,
"en": "Really? Then it makes sense to stay here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21496,
"en": "You guys better keep stopping by to support me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21497,
"en": "We know that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 15
},
{
"id": 21498,
"en": "Leave it to us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 15
},
{
"id": 21499,
"en": "This place calms me down. You guys are like my family.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21500,
"en": "You HAVE a family, Hatakeyama-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21501,
"en": "So I have two families.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 31
},
{
"id": 21502,
"en": "Can you say that in front of your daughter?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21503,
"en": "Er... well...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21504,
"en": "Haha, but you're more or less right. This place feels like home.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21505,
"en": "My worries go away when I drink with the rest of the regulars.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21506,
"en": "\"Regulars\" are a surprisingly important thing for a bar to have.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21507,
"en": "Y'know, I've never even thought about that until now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 63
},
{
"id": 21508,
"en": "Maybe it's because a new wind blew through.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 47
},
{
"id": 21509,
"en": "A new wind?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 15
},
{
"id": 21510,
"en": "That's obviously Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21511,
"en": "Absolutely. Kiryu-san listened to all of our troubles.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21512,
"en": "You're a broad-minded man.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21513,
"en": "Sounds like you've really helped everyone here, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21514,
"en": "I'm lookin' forward to more great times with you, rookie!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21515,
"en": "He doesn't really come off as a rookie.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21516,
"en": "You guys...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|# …",
"max": 15
},
{
"id": 21517,
"en": "To a future filled with delicious drinks!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 47
},
{
"id": 21518,
"en": "So let's toast!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 15
},
{
"id": 21519,
"en": "Wait, I lost my train of thought...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 47
},
{
"id": 21520,
"en": "Come on, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 31
},
{
"id": 21521,
"en": "You have to end with a baaaang.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21522,
"en": "(If only I had something to say...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_b22|# + talk",
"max": 47
},
{
"id": 21523,
"en": "You got a great voice.\nIt really pulled me in.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21524,
"en": "Really? Thanks.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21525,
"en": "I'm a bit of a singer myself.\nFolks call me Gen.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21526,
"en": "I'm Kiryu.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|# …",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21527,
"en": "Kiryu-san, huh? I like ya.\nWe oughta drink together.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21528,
"en": "Yeah, next time I'll sit by you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21529,
"en": "Great! Lookin' forward to it!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21530,
"en": "Oh, Kiryu-san.\nI was just telling this guy 'bout you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21531,
"en": "Hm? About me?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21532,
"en": "Nice to meet you, I'm Akiyoshi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21533,
"en": "Kiryu-san, I heard y'helped Hatakeyama-san\nwith his troubles and cheered him right up.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21534,
"en": "I thought y'were kinda scary,\nso I avoided ya...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21535,
"en": "But now that I know yer a fine fella,\nwe oughta talk sometime!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21536,
"en": "That all it takes to change yer tune?\nMaybe y'oughta talk to this guy, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21537,
"en": "Lookin' forward to it!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21538,
"en": "Heh, nice. I could always use new drinking\nbuddies. We'll talk soon, Akiyoshi-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21539,
"en": "Great!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21540,
"en": "Yo, Kiryu-san... Right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21541,
"en": "I didn't take you for being too invested in\nthis place. Figured you'd leave, but I was wrong.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21542,
"en": "Meaning what?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21543,
"en": "Sometimes we do get some new\npeople in outside of the regulars.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21544,
"en": "But most come t'flirt with Mama or\nignore us and talk about themselves...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21545,
"en": "They hog the karaoke and then\ndisappear. That's the type we usually get.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21546,
"en": "That sounds terrible.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21547,
"en": "But you seem to have good manners and\na decent reputation with the others.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21548,
"en": "Maybe we were off the mark on ya...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21549,
"en": "Sorry fer the cold shoulder. It's a little late,\nbut y'mind sharing a few drinks?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21550,
"en": "I'd like to apologize for being so rude, too.\nThink you'd want to have a drink with us?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21551,
"en": "Both of you... Of course.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21552,
"en": "All right, then let's get some drinks!\nI'm Kaneko, by the way.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21553,
"en": "An' I'm Ando.\nI own a shop called Otafuku Pawn.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21554,
"en": "Kaneko-san and Ando-san.\nLooking forward to sharing a drink.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack_kikkake|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21555,
"en": "You piece of shit... Whaddya think\nyou were doing to our Yuka-chan!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21556,
"en": "You might be the Kabedon Prince, but\nthat don't give ya the right to mess with her!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21557,
"en": "Kabedon...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21558,
"en": "I told you, it was just for the show!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21559,
"en": "Yuka-san and I have nothing\ngoing on in real life, I swear!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 21560,
"en": "Shut your face! I don't care if it's real or not.\nYou... You kabedon'd our sweet Yuka-chan!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a01|#",
"max": null
}
]